{
 "title": "Overwork",
 "children": [
  {
   "title": "What it is",
   "lines": [
    "26 machines on the",
    "live input, with a",
    "step sequencer that",
    "parameter-locks",
    "them.",
    "A source stage and",
    "two insert FX in",
    "series, three LFOs."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Eight tracks",
   "lines": [
    "Each has its own",
    "source, two FX, a",
    "filter, LFOs and its",
    "own sequencer lane.",
    "",
    "UP / DOWN step",
    "through them.",
    "MENU + a step button",
    "jumps straight to",
    "that track.",
    "",
    "The bar under the",
    "title is all eight:",
    "solid is selected,",
    "underlined has trigs.",
    "",
    "MIDI channel N plays",
    "track N."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Feedback guard",
   "lines": [
    "With the speakers",
    "live and nothing in",
    "the input jack, the",
    "mic hears the",
    "speakers. Overwork",
    "mutes the input",
    "automatically and",
    "says so on screen.",
    "",
    "SHIFT + Fill pad",
    "overrides it."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "The main gesture",
   "lines": [
    "HOLD a step button",
    "and TURN a knob.",
    "That parameter is",
    "now locked on that",
    "step.",
    "Hold+Shift+knob",
    "edits the base",
    "value instead."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Step buttons",
   "lines": [
    "Tap: trig on/off",
    "Hold+knob: lock",
    "Hold+Shift+knob:",
    "  edit base value",
    "Hold+jog: set the",
    "  attribute the mode",
    "  pad selected",
    "Shift+pad 75:",
    "  clear its locks"
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Step LEDs",
   "lines": [
    "Dim: in length,",
    "no trig",
    "White: plain trig",
    "Green: has locks",
    "Cyan: conditional",
    "Red: playhead",
    "Bright green: held"
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Pads rows 1-3",
   "lines": [
    "Machine palette for",
    "the FOCUSED STAGE:",
    "6 sources on SRC,",
    "21 effects on FX 1",
    "and FX 2. Tap to",
    "load one. The",
    "loaded machine is",
    "white; pads past",
    "the family are",
    "dark."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Pad row 4",
   "lines": [
    "Play/Stop, Fill,",
    "Stage focus,",
    "Pattern page,",
    "Edit page,",
    "Copy, Paste, Clear.",
    "",
    "SHIFT + 68 arms",
    "LIVE RECORD.",
    "SHIFT + 71-75 =",
    "Prob, Cond, Micro,",
    "Retrig, ClearLocks."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Knobs and jog",
   "lines": [
    "Knobs 1-8 are the",
    "edit page's eight",
    "parameters.",
    "Jog sets pattern",
    "length, or the held",
    "step's attribute.",
    "Jog click cycles",
    "the edit page."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Trig conditions",
   "lines": [
    "FILL and !FIL react",
    "to the Fill pad.",
    "PRE and !PRE follow",
    "the last condition.",
    "1ST fires only on",
    "the first pass.",
    "A:B fires on pass A",
    "of every B."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Lock behaviour",
   "lines": [
    "Each firing trig is",
    "a full snapshot:",
    "locked params take",
    "their value, others",
    "go back to base.",
    "A trig that does",
    "not fire changes",
    "nothing.",
    "",
    "36 lockables: the",
    "3 stages, their",
    "machines, level,",
    "pan and the voice",
    "filter. Global MIX",
    "is not one - it is",
    "not per track."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Notes",
   "lines": [
    "Retrig restarts the",
    "LFOs and the filter",
    "envelope, it does",
    "not stutter audio.",
    "Use Decimator FREZ",
    "for that.",
    "Start/continue",
    "restarts pattern."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Presets",
   "lines": [
    "Shift + jog click",
    "opens the browser.",
    "Jog scrolls, click",
    "loads. Top entry",
    "saves a new one.",
    "Clear pad deletes.",
    "",
    "They live outside",
    "the module, so a",
    "reinstall keeps them"
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Granulator",
   "lines": [
    "Granulates the last",
    "2 s of live input.",
    "TUNE +/-2 oct, DENS",
    "how often grains",
    "fire, SIZE their",
    "length, POS where",
    "in the buffer, SCAN",
    "moves that point,",
    "SPRD scatters it,",
    "AMNT how many."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "The reverbs",
   "lines": [
    "Three different",
    "algorithms, not one",
    "with three presets:",
    "",
    "Roomtone: room",
    "with early refl.",
    "Iron Room: plate",
    "Voidspace: FDN,",
    "smoothest decay."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Live record",
   "lines": [
    "Shift + Play arms",
    "it. With the seq",
    "running, turning a",
    "knob writes a lock",
    "onto the step that",
    "is playing, and",
    "arms a trig there.",
    "",
    "The play pad turns",
    "red while armed."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Probability",
   "lines": [
    "Per step, 1-100.",
    "Separate from the",
    "trig condition:",
    "both must pass.",
    "",
    "Shift + pattern page",
    "picks the mode,",
    "then hold a step",
    "and turn the jog."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Modulation",
   "lines": [
    "Four LFOs in two",
    "families, plus an AHD",
    "envelope.",
    "",
    "VOICE LFO 1 and 2",
    "reach the source",
    "stage and the voice",
    "filter.",
    "",
    "FX LFO 1 and 2 reach",
    "the two inserts.",
    "",
    "A voice LFO cannot",
    "reach an insert, and",
    "that is deliberate.",
    "",
    "Order per block:",
    "base, lock,",
    "envelope, LFOs."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "MIDI CC",
   "lines": [
    "Track N listens on",
    "channel N.",
    "",
    "8-15 FX 1 A-H",
    "16-23 FX 2 A-H",
    "24/25 FX machines",
    "26 dry/wet",
    "27/28 level, pan",
    "32 V.LFO 1",
    "40 V.LFO 2",
    "48 FX LFO 1",
    "96 FX LFO 2",
    "56-60 mod envelope",
    "80-87 source A-H",
    "88 source machine"
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Pattern bank",
   "lines": [
    "16 patterns.",
    "SHIFT + a step",
    "button selects one.",
    "",
    "The screen header",
    "shows P1-P16, and",
    "S when song mode",
    "is running."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Undo and song",
   "lines": [
    "Pad 81: undo,",
    "shift+tap = redo.",
    "Pad 82: tap recalls,",
    "hold memorizes.",
    "Pad 83: song mode.",
    "",
    "Song rows chain",
    "patterns with",
    "repeat counts."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Trig types",
   "lines": [
    "A full trig applies",
    "its locks AND",
    "restarts the LFOs",
    "and envelope.",
    "",
    "A lock trig applies",
    "locks only —",
    "the classic trigless",
    "lock."
   ]
  }
 ]
}